    {
      "id": "next-template-detail",
      "type": "face",
      "label": "Decision memo",
      "position": {
        "x": -1100,
        "y": 1233
      },
      "width": 450,
      "height": 300,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270
        }
      ],
      "handles": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270,
          "portId": "root"
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "next-template-demo"
        },
        "view": {
          "intent": "node",
          "payload": "node.web.detail",
          "scroll": "page"
        },
        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:auto;background:#f7f9fc;font-family:Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'><div style='box-sizing:border-box;min-height:100%;padding:4.4cqw 7cqw 5cqw'><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1e40af'>Decision <span style='display:inline-block;padding:.3cqw 1.4cqw;border-radius:9cqw;font:700 1.3cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle;background:#1e40af;color:#fff'>Decided</span></div><div style='font:700 5.2cqw/1.12 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#1f2937'>Which template should we build next?</div><div style='font:400 2.1cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:2cqw;max-width:62cqw'>Person Profile is done and the idea map is a recipe, not a template. Three candidates are left, and each takes days to do properly.</div><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1e40af;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(30,64,175,.35)'>Worth knowing</div><div style='margin-bottom:1.6cqw'><div style='font:700 1.8cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>The idea map already exists</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Thinking something through is covered by a recipe in the guide, so it is not a candidate.</div></div><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1e40af;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(30,64,175,.35)'>What matters</div><div style='margin-bottom:1.8cqw'><div style='font:700 1.8cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Useful on first contact <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#7e22ce;font-size:1.5cqw' title='high'>●●●<span style='opacity:.25'></span></span></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>A person who has just met Twilite should get something from it in their first few minutes.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:1.8cqw'><div style='font:700 1.8cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Small to build <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#7e22ce;font-size:1.5cqw' title='medium'>●●<span style='opacity:.25'>●</span></span></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Days, not weeks: a few card classes, a few edges and one Method.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:1.8cqw'><div style='font:700 1.8cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Others can build on it <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#7e22ce;font-size:1.5cqw' title='low'>●<span style='opacity:.25'>●●</span></span></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Its cards and edges are the kind other templates will reuse.</div></div><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1e40af;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(30,64,175,.35)'>The options</div><div style='margin-bottom:2.6cqw;padding:2cqw 2.4cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fff;border:.3cqw solid #b45309'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2cqw;align-items:baseline'><div style='font:700 2.1cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Decision<span style='margin-left:1.4cqw;color:#b45309;font:800 1.3cqw/1 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase'>chosen</span></div><div style='flex:0 0 auto;font:600 1.4cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b;white-space:nowrap'><span style='color:#15803d'>3 for</span> · <span style='color:#b91c1c'>0 against</span></div></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Options, what matters, and what counts for and against each, with the choice left to the person.</div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.2cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:.7cqw'><span style='color:#15803d;font:800 1.7cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>+</span><span style='font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Useful on first contact</b> <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#15803d;font-size:1.5cqw' title='high'>●●●<span style='opacity:.25'></span></span> · people bring choices to an AI all the time</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.2cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:.7cqw'><span style='color:#15803d;font:800 1.7cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>+</span><span style='font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Small to build</b> <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#15803d;font-size:1.5cqw' title='medium'>●●<span style='opacity:.25'>●</span></span> · four cards and six edges, like the profile</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.2cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:.7cqw'><span style='color:#15803d;font:800 1.7cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>+</span><span style='font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Others can build on it</b> <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#15803d;font-size:1.5cqw' title='low'>●<span style='opacity:.25'>●●</span></span> · its options and criteria turn up in plans</span></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:2.6cqw;padding:2cqw 2.4cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2cqw;align-items:baseline'><div style='font:700 2.1cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Learn a topic</div><div style='flex:0 0 auto;font:600 1.4cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b;white-space:nowrap'><span style='color:#15803d'>1 for</span> · <span style='color:#b91c1c'>1 against</span></div></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>A concept map for studying something: what to know, in what order, and how well it is known.</div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.2cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:.7cqw'><span style='color:#15803d;font:800 1.7cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>+</span><span style='font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Useful on first contact</b> <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#15803d;font-size:1.5cqw' title='high'>●●●<span style='opacity:.25'></span></span> · a common first request</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.2cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:.7cqw'><span style='color:#b91c1c;font:800 1.7cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>−</span><span style='font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Small to build</b> <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#b91c1c;font-size:1.5cqw' title='medium'>●●<span style='opacity:.25'>●</span></span> · needs a notion of what is known, which is new</span></div></div><div style='margin-bottom:2.6cqw;padding:2cqw 2.4cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2cqw;align-items:baseline'><div style='font:700 2.1cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Story</div><div style='flex:0 0 auto;font:600 1.4cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b;white-space:nowrap'><span style='color:#15803d'>0 for</span> · <span style='color:#b91c1c'>2 against</span></div></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Characters, scenes and how they connect, for planning a piece of fiction.</div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.2cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:.7cqw'><span style='color:#b91c1c;font:800 1.7cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>−</span><span style='font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Useful on first contact</b> <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#b91c1c;font-size:1.5cqw' title='high'>●●●<span style='opacity:.25'></span></span> · few people start with a story</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1.2cqw;align-items:baseline;margin-top:.7cqw'><span style='color:#b91c1c;font:800 1.7cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>−</span><span style='font:400 1.6cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155'><b style='font-weight:700;color:#1f2937'>Small to build</b> <span style='letter-spacing:.12em;color:#b91c1c;font-size:1.5cqw' title='medium'>●●<span style='opacity:.25'>●</span></span> · needs a structure for scenes</span></div></div><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1e40af;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(30,64,175,.35)'>Where this landed</div><div style='padding:2.2cqw 2.6cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fff;border:.3cqw solid #b45309'><div style='font:700 2.4cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Decision</div><div style='font:italic 1.8cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.8cqw'>The one people reach for first, and the smallest to build.</div></div></div></div>"
        },
        "memo": "The Detail: the decision as a short memo, written from the cards. The Method writes it, so edit the cards and not this.",
